theorem `Rel.sub_left` / 定理 `Rel.sub_left`

English:
theorem Rel.sub_left
  given: {R : Type uR} [Ring R] {r : R -> R -> Prop} ⦃a b c
  statement: R⦄ (h : Rel r a b) :
