theorem `Rel.sub_right` / 定理 `Rel.sub_right`

English:
theorem Rel.sub_right
  given: {R : Type uR} [Ring R] {r : R -> R -> Prop} ⦃a b c
  statement: R⦄ (h : Rel r b c) :
  proof: by simp only [sub_eq_add_neg, h.neg.add_right]

