theorem `Rel.smul` / 定理 `Rel.smul`

English:
theorem Rel.smul
  given: {r : A -> A -> Prop} (k : S) ⦃a b
  statement: A⦄ (h : Rel r a b) : Rel r (k • a) (k • b)
  proof: by
